  "subject": "Invoice PMP-INV-0042 for Inner West Pickleball Club: 23 paddles re-gritted",
  "text": "Hi Jo,

Your batch PMPB-4K7QX is back: 23 paddles re-gritted for Inner West Pickleball Club. Here’s the invoice.

  Invoice: PMP-INV-0042
