exports[`email templates > customer_submitted (production) renders the same text and HTML as approved 1`] = `
{
  "html": "<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-AU"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="color-scheme" content="light"><title>We’ve got your order PMP-7K3QX</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#FBFAF6;font-family:'Work Sans',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" style="background:#FBFAF6;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:24px 12px">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;border-collapse:separate">
<tr><td style="padding:20px 24px;border-bottom:4px solid #78A472"><span style="font-family:Sora,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#4565A6">Pickle<span style="color:#3F6B3E">My</span>Paddle</span></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:24px">
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1E2E52">Hi Sam,</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1E2E52">Thanks for your order. Your reference is PMP-7K3QX.</p>
<h2 style="margin:24px 0 8px;font-size:17px;color:#1E2E52">Your paddles</h2>
<ul style="margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:20px;color:#1E2E52"><li style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5">Selkirk Vanguard Power Air</li><li style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5">JOOLA</li></ul>
<h2 style="margin:24px 0 8px;font-size:17px;color:#1E2E52">What happens next</h2>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1E2E52">We’ll look at your photos and reply within 1 business day, either to confirm we can re-grit your paddles or with a question. There’s nothing to pay yet.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1E2E52">Your estimate is A$120 for re-gritting (A$60 a paddle), plus return postage. Once we’ve accepted your order, we’ll email the total with postage, how to pay and where to post your paddles.</p>
<p style="margin:8px 0 24px"><a href="https://www.picklemypaddle.com/order/status#TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTT" style="display:inline-block;background:#4565A6;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:8px">See your order’s progress</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#1E2E52;opacity:.75">This link is private to you: anyone who has it can see your order’s progress, but not your name or address. If you lose it, use “Email me my links” on the status page.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1E2E52">A reminder: re-gritted paddles aren’t allowed in sanctioned tournaments, so keep these for social and club play.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1E2E52">Thanks,<br>PickleMyPaddle</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#1E2E52;opacity:.75">PickleMyPaddle: pickleball paddle re-grits, a small business operated out of Sydney.<br>https://www.picklemypaddle.com<br>Questions? Just reply to this email.<br>You’re getting this because an order was placed with this email address.</p>
</td></tr></table>
</td></tr></table>
</body></html>
",
  "subject": "We’ve got your order PMP-7K3QX",
  "text": "Hi Sam,

Thanks for your order. Your reference is PMP-7K3QX.

YOUR PADDLES

  - Selkirk Vanguard Power Air
  - JOOLA

WHAT HAPPENS NEXT

We’ll look at your photos and reply within 1 business day, either to confirm we can re-grit your paddles or with a question. There’s nothing to pay yet.

Your estimate is A$120 for re-gritting (A$60 a paddle), plus return postage. Once we’ve accepted your order, we’ll email the total with postage, how to pay and where to post your paddles.

See your order’s progress:
https://www.picklemypaddle.com/order/status#TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTT

This link is private to you: anyone who has it can see your order’s progress, but not your name or address. If you lose it, use “Email me my links” on the status page.

A reminder: re-gritted paddles aren’t allowed in sanctioned tournaments, so keep these for social and club play.

Thanks,
PickleMyPaddle

PickleMyPaddle: pickleball paddle re-grits, a small business operated out of Sydney.
https://www.picklemypaddle.com
Questions? Just reply to this email.
You’re getting this because an order was placed with this email address.
",
}
`;

